sequenceDiagram
  participant U as user
  participant C as projview CLI
  participant B as browser
  U->>C: projview ./docs
  C->>C: walk + index (in memory)
  C->>B: open localhost
  B->>C: GET /api/tree
  C-->>B: file tree json
  B->>C: GET /api/file?p=...
  C-->>B: rendered html
  Note over C,B: edit a file -> SSE -> live reload
